# Bulk data artifacts are NOT distributed through git.
#
# The serving path is the direct upload in
# scripts/run_tickertape_publish_pipeline.sh -> run_upload() ->
# cerebral-insights-platform/scripts/load_tickertape_to_server.sh
#
# Committing these pushed hundreds of MB per daily refresh, and each
# revision of the SQLite databases stored a full new copy in Git LFS
# (tickertape.sqlite is 5.0 GB, market_intel.db is 1.3 GB).
local_repository/raw/
local_repository/tickertape.sqlite
system/market_intel.db
